{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39898","headline":"龙蛰二首 一 · 徐夤","name":"龙蛰二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙蛰蛇蟠却待伸，和光何惜且同尘。\n伍员岂是吹箫者，冀缺非同执耒人。\n神剑触星当变化，良金成器在陶钧。\n穰侯休忌关东客，张禄先生竟相秦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}